{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118598","id":3532963371,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SlL4r","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118598","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118598.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118598.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118598","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118598/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118598/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118598/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9b0d85c3a03d24d681f124758eaaaf96315e12f6","number":118598,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript LSP: Convert [color] BBCode to <span> HTML for capable clients","user":{"login":"Finishxx","id":78695266,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Njk1MjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78695266?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx","html_url":"https://github.com/Finishxx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finishxx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14633\r\n\r\nThe GDScript LSP currently strips `[color]` BBCode tags when converting documentation to Markdown, since Markdown has no equivalent. This PR preserves it for capable clients by converting `[color=...]` to `<span style=\"color:...\">`, but only if the client declares support for it.\r\n\r\nSpecifically, conversion is applied only when `\"span\"` is included in `general.markdown.allowedTags`:\r\nhttps://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#markdownClientCapabilities\r\n\r\nClients that do not advertise this capability are unaffected, and the existing stripping behavior is preserved.\r\n\r\nTested with Rider (via https://github.com/JetBrains/godot-support/commit/476f5d36bef9f2e33c7830ff83d60179ccbaaa28), and verified that VS Code, Zed, and Vim clients are unaffected.\r\n\r\nAI disclaimer: the original proof-of-concept in the proposal was written by AI, whilst this PR was written by hand.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"